---
title: "pause and unpause (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth_pause: operator calls pause() or unpause()
    q_check_auth_pause --> q_error_auth: caller is not Legion operator
    q_error_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth_pause --> q_decide: caller is Legion operator
    q_decide --> q_pause: action == pause
    q_decide --> q_unpause: action == unpause
    q_pause --> q_check_not_paused: check paused == false
    q_check_not_paused --> q_error_already_paused: paused == true
    q_error_already_paused --> [*]: revert AlreadyPaused
    q_check_not_paused --> q_set_paused: paused == false
    q_set_paused --> [*]: paused = true, emit Paused
    q_unpause --> q_check_paused: check paused == true
    q_check_paused --> q_error_not_paused: paused == false
    q_error_not_paused --> [*]: revert NotPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_set_unpaused: paused == true
    q_set_unpaused --> [*]: paused = false, emit Unpaused

    note right of q_decide
        INV-001: Pause suspends invest, withdrawExcess, claimTokenAllocation
        INV-002: Pause does NOT block withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (investor fund access preserved)
        INV-003: paused toggles between true and false
    end note
